    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3502" root="بوب" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَوْبَاةٌ</span></b>  <i>A desert;</i> or <i>a desert in which is no water;</i>
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَلَاةٌ</span>: (T, IJ, M, K:) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْمَاةٌ</span>; (T, MF;)
the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ب</span> being changed into <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">م</span>, as is often the case.
(MF.) [It is mentioned in the S, and again in
the K, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بو</span>, as <i>syn. with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَفَازَةٌ</span>.]

